e absence of the media-mongodb ConfigMap, causing the volume mount to fail, hence the pod remains in ContainerCreating state.\n</think>\n\nThe missing `media-mongodb` ConfigMap is the root cause. The pod\'s volume mount depends on this ConfigMap, but it does not exist in the namespace. This absence prevents the container from starting, as the required configuration file (`mongod.conf`) cannot be mounted. \n\n**Root Cause:**  \nThe `media-mongodb` ConfigMap is missing from the `social-network` namespace, leading to a failed volume mount and preventing the MongoDB container from initializing. This is likely due to an uncreated or deleted ConfigMap, or a typo in the ConfigMap name referenced in the deployment spec. \n\n**Submission:**  \nThe media-mongodb pod fails to start because the required ConfigMap `media-mongodb` is missing in the `social-network` namespace, causing a volume mount failure. This absence prevents the MongoDB container from initializing, resulting in the pod remaining in a "ContainerCreating" state.', additional_kwargs={'provider_specific_fields': {'reasoning': None, 'refusal': None}}, response_metadata={'token_usage': Usage(completion_tokens=745, prompt_tokens=5710, total_tokens=6455, completion_tokens_details=None, prompt_tokens_details=None), 'model': 'openai/Qwen/Qwen3-8B', 'finish_reason': 'stop', 'logprobs': None, 'model_name': 'openai/Qwen/Qwen3-8B'}, id='lc_run--019cfc7c-80bb-7880-b42e-a91998609780-0', tool_calls=[], invalid_tool_calls=[], usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 5710, 'output_tokens': 745, 'total_tokens': 6455}), HumanMessage(content='Now generate a tool call according to your last chosen tool.', additional_kwargs={}, response_metadata={}, id='2f005439-7be3-4e8a-80b1-da850b3dcd6e')]]
